b1 20 mcg Dose: 18-55 Years of Age","description":"Participants aged 18-55 years were randomized to receive 20 microgram BNT162b1 vaccine 250 microgram/0.5 milliliter intramuscularly separated by 21 days interval as part of this study."},{"id":"OG002","title":"BNT162b1 30 mcg Dose: 18-55 Years of Age","description":"Participants aged 18-55 years were randomized to receive 30 microgram BNT162b1 vaccine 250 microgram/0.5 milliliter intramuscularly separated by 21 days interval as part of this study."},{"id":"OG003","title":"Placebo: 18-55 Years of Age for BNT162b1","description":"Participants aged 18-55 years were randomized to receive 0.9% sodium chloride solution for Injection intramuscularly."},{"id":"OG004","title":"BNT162b1 100 mcg Dose, 18-55 Years of Age","description":"Participants aged 18-55 years were randomized to receive 2 doses of 100 microgram BNT162b1 vaccine 250 microgram/0.5 milliliter intramuscularly and received only 1 dose due to reactogenicity."},{"id":"OG005","title":"Placebo 18-55 Years of Age for BNT162b1 100 mcg","description":"Participants aged 18-55 years were randomized to receive 0.9% sodium chloride solution for injection intramuscularly."},{"id":"OG006","title":"BNT162b2 10 mcg Dose, 18-55 Years of Age","description":"Participants aged 18-55 years were randomized to receive 2 doses of 10 microgram BNT162b2 vaccine (250 microgram/0.5 milliliter) intramuscularly separated by 21 days interval as part of this study."},{"id":"OG007","title":"BNT162b2 20 mcg Dose, 18-55 Years of Age","description":"Participants aged 18-55 years were randomized to receive 2 doses of 20 microgram BNT162b2 vaccine 250 microgram/0.5 milliliter intramuscularly separated by 21 days interval as part of this study."},{"id":"OG008","title":"BNT162b2 30 mcg Dose, 18-55 Years of Age","description":"Participants aged 18-55 years were randomized to receive 2 doses of 30 microgram BNT162b2 vaccine 250 microgram/0.5 milliliter intramuscularly separated by 21 days interval as part of this study."},{"id":"OG009","title":"Placebo: 18-55 Years of Age for BNT162b2","description":"Participants aged 18-55 years were randomized to receive 0.9% sodium chloride solution for injection intramuscularly."},{"id":"OG010","title":"BNT162b1 10 mcg Dose, 65-85 Years of Age","description":"Participants aged 65-85 years were randomized to receive 2 doses of 10 microgram BNT162b1 vaccine 250 microgram/0.5 milliliter intramuscularly separated by 21 days interval as part of this study."},{"id":"OG011","title":"BNT162b1 20 mcg Dose, 65-85 Years of Age","description":"Participants aged 65-85 years were randomized to receive 2 doses of 20 microgram BNT162b1 vaccine 250 microgram/0.5 milliliter intramuscularly separated by 21 days interval as part of this study."},{"id":"OG012","title":"BNT162b1 30 mcg Dose, 65-85 Years of Age","description":"Participants aged 65-85 years were randomized to receive 2 doses of 30 microgram BNT162b1 vaccine 250 microgram/0.5 milliliter intramuscularly separated by 21 days interval as part of this study."},{"id":"OG013","title":"Placebo, 65-85 Years of Age for BNT162b1","description":"Participants aged 65-85 years were randomized to receive 0.9% sodium chloride solution for injection intramuscularly."},{"id":"OG014","title":"BNT162b2 10 mcg Dose, 65-85 Years of Age","description":"Participants aged 65-85 years were randomized to receive 10 microgram BNT162b2 vaccine 250 microgram/0.5 milliliter intramuscularly separated by 21 days interval as part of this study."},{"id":"OG015","title":"BNT162b2 20 mcg Dose, 65-85 Years of Age","description":"Participants aged 65-85 years were randomized to receive 20 microgram BNT162b2 vaccine 250 microgram/0.5 milliliter intramuscularly separated by 21 days interval as part of this study."},{"id":"OG016","title":"BNT162b2 30 mcg Dose, 65-85 Years of Age","description":"Participants aged 65-85 years were randomized to receive 30 microgram BNT162b2 vaccine 250 microgram/0.5 milliliter intramuscular