ll randomized participants who received at least 1 dose of the study intervention. Here, ''N'' signifies the participant was in the safety population and had e-diary data after Dose 2.","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"NUMBER","dispersionType":"95% Confidence Interval","unitOfMeasure":"Percentage of participants","timeFrame":"Within 7 days after Dose 2","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"BNT162b1 10 mcg Dose: 18-55 Years of Age","description":"Participants aged 18-55 years were randomized to receive 2 doses of 10 mcg BNT162b1 vaccine (250 microgram/0.5 milliliter) intramuscularly separated by 21 days interval as part of this study."},{"id":"OG001","title":"BNT162b1 20 mcg Dose: 18-55 Years of Age","description":"Participants aged 18-55 years were randomized to receive 20 microgram BNT162b1 vaccine 250 microgram/0.5 milliliter intramuscularly separated by 21 days interval as part of this study."},{"id":"OG002","title":"BNT162b1 30 mcg Dose: 18-55 Years of Age","description":"Participants aged 18-55 years were randomized to receive 30 microgram BNT162b1 vaccine 250 microgram/0.5 milliliter intramuscularly separated by 21 days interval as part of this study."},{"id":"OG003","title":"Placebo: 18-55 Years of Age for BNT162b1","description":"Participants aged 18-55 years were randomized to receive 0.9% sodium chloride solution for Injection intramuscularly."},{"id":"OG004","title":"BNT162b2 10 mcg Dose, 18-55 Years of Age","description":"Participants aged 18-55 years were randomized to receive 2 doses of 10 microgram BNT162b2 vaccine (250 microgram/0.5 milliliter) intramuscularly separated by 21 days interval as part of this study."},{"id":"OG005","title":"BNT162b2 20 mcg Dose, 18-55 Years of Age","description":"Participants aged 18-55 years were randomized to receive 2 doses of 20 microgram BNT162b2 vaccine 250 microgram/0.5 milliliter intramuscularly separated by 21 days interval as part of this study."},{"id":"OG006","title":"BNT162b2 30 mcg Dose, 18-55 Years of Age","description":"Participants aged 18-55 years were randomized to receive 2 doses of 30 microgram BNT162b2 vaccine 250 microgram/0.5 milliliter intramuscularly separated by 21 days interval as part of this study."},{"id":"OG007","title":"Placebo: 18-55 Years of Age for BNT162b2","description":"Participants aged 18-55 years were randomized to receive 0.9% sodium chloride solution for injection intramuscularly."},{"id":"OG008","title":"BNT162b1 10 mcg Dose, 65-85 Years of Age","description":"Participants aged 65-85 years were randomized to receive 2 doses of 10 microgram BNT162b1 vaccine 250 microgram/0.5 milliliter intramuscularly separated by 21 days interval as part of this study."},{"id":"OG009","title":"BNT162b1 20 mcg Dose, 65-85 Years of Age","description":"Participants aged 65-85 years were randomized to receive 2 doses of 20 microgram BNT162b1 vaccine 250 microgram/0.5 milliliter intramuscularly separated by 21 days interval as part of this study."},{"id":"OG010","title":"BNT162b1 30 mcg Dose, 65-85 Years of Age","description":"Participants aged 65-85 years were randomized to receive 2 doses of 30 microgram BNT162b1 vaccine 250 microgram/0.5 milliliter intramuscularly separated by 21 days interval as part of this study."},{"id":"OG011","title":"Placebo, 65-85 Years of Age for BNT162b1","description":"Participants aged 65-85 years were randomized to receive 0.9% sodium chloride solution for injection intramuscularly."},{"id":"OG012","title":"BNT162b2 10 mcg Dose, 65-85 Years of Age","description":"Participants aged 65-85 years were randomized to receive 10 microgram BNT162b2 vaccine 250 microgram/0.5 milliliter intramuscularly separated by 21 days interval as part of this study."},{"id":"OG013","title":"BNT162b2 20 mcg Dose, 65-85 Years of Age","description":"Participants aged 65-85 years were randomized to receive 20 microgram BNT162b2 vaccine 250 microgram/0.5 milliliter intramuscularly separated by 21 days interval as part of this study."},{"id":"OG014","